        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Health-related worry"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Very anxious about throat cancer and silent reflux after searching online; repeatedly asked whether it could be serious and whether a scan or camera was needed, and whether it was 100% not cancer. Longstanding pattern of health anxiety and frequent checking; remains quite anxious despite reassurance."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
